":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"QwawOSEJKaFd5yCYtrN6DQ","review_id":"IIq3JbmJp7yGEJsTRKhJlA","date":"2017-03-29T13:47:01","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9377532005310059,"text_excerpt":"Walking around downtown New Orleans, I started thinking about souvenirs to bring people at home. I didn't realize but Pralines were a big New Orleans thing. This store was just sitting there on the side of the street in the early evening was the most brightly lit store around - very inviting. I stepped in and looked around initially looking to bring some sort of snack back to friends at home. They have it all from sweet to savory. They also have a great section on cook books with ingredients that you can also take home with you. I decided to dip into both sections both savory and sweet. Brought some candied pecans of various flavors and then bought some fille powder and a creole/cajun coo..."},{"business_id":"QwawOSEJKaFd5yCYtrN6DQ","review_id":"Sy2oNsMqndGkEXRWv1WNZQ","date":"2012-07-18T04:57:11","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9328807592391968,"text_excerpt":"This store sold some Praline among other items. I thought the prices were reasonable and a lot of the items here were food but there were also books. The people who worked here were nice. I didn't buy anything because I knew I didn't have room in my luggage. However, my friends did buy some Praline for their friends/family. Good place for some Praline and other items like hot sauces. Check it out!"},{"business_id":"QwawOSEJKaFd5yCYtrN6DQ","review_id":"ResWQjYyq7FRQQvgqJxSOQ","date":"2016-11-30T06:04:10","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9215178489685059,"text_excerpt":"Royal Praline Company is a one-stop souvenir shop for tourists. My friends and I literally bought 90% of our souvenirs and gifts for family here. They have everything from pralines and Cafe du Monde coffee to shot glasses and umbrellas here. The shop is pretty large and it's easy to kill 20 minutes browsing the shelves for that perfect souvenir item. The staff were nice enough and will make recommendations on the best pralines to get if you ask. And don't be a dummy like me and forget to check in for a sweet 15% off coupon! YELP 100 CHALLENGE 2016: #77"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"QwawOSEJKaFd5yCYtrN6DQ","photo_id":"gTZx2RSpPKIsi_BpPYgi5g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/gTZx2RSpPKIsi_BpPYgi5g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8642891645431519},{"business_id":"QwawOSEJKaFd5yCYtrN6DQ","photo_id":"Tj9OAFhS1A5vZ83LA3LqpQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/Tj9OAFhS1A5vZ83LA3LqpQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8465924263000488},{"business_id":"QwawOSEJKaFd5yCYtrN6DQ","photo_id":"F50LZvSO5kjJt7kT6nQ0kQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/F50LZvSO5kjJt7kT6nQ0kQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8277653455734253},{"business_id":"QwawOSEJKaFd5yCYtrN6DQ","photo_id":"YgaQWknKoRlQDded6uL0QA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/YgaQWknKoRlQDded6uL0QA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7825034856796265},{"business_id":"QwawOSEJKaFd5yCYtrN6DQ","photo_id":"pVHvmYI-pdC_NHg1aiOdOw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/pVHvmYI-pdC_NHg1aiOdOw.jpg","visua